   .. admonition:: Operate with the Voltage Regulator
      :class: note dropdown

      .. rubric:: Operate with the on-chip voltage regulator unit:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **regulator vlist vreg**
            0.550000 V
            0.600000 V
            0.650000 V
            0.700000 V
            0.750000 V
            0.800000 V
            0.850000 V
            0.900000 V
            0.950000 V
            1.000000 V
            1.050000 V
            1.100000 V
            1.150000 V
            1.200000 V
            1.250000 V
            1.300000 V
            1.350000 V
            1.400000 V
            1.500000 V
            1.600000 V
            1.650000 V
            1.700000 V
            1.800000 V
            1.900000 V
            2.000000 V
            2.350000 V
            2.500000 V
            2.650000 V
            2.800000 V
            3.000000 V
            3.150000 V
            3.300000 V

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **regulator vget vreg**
            1.100000 V

      .. .. rubric:: Trigger a power-off/on sequence on ARM Cortex-M33 ``@4mb`` revision:

      .. .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **hwinfo reset_cause**
            reset caused by:
            - pin

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **regulator disable vreg**
            [00:00:00.001,000] <inf> board_control: mini_usb_rp2350\ @\ 4mb/rp2350a/m33_0
            [00:00:00.001,000] <inf> board_control: QSPI-Flash: **4MB**
            \*\*\* Booting Zephyr OS build |zephyr_version_em|\ *…*\*\*\*
            Hello World! I'm THE SHELL from mini_usb_rp2350

      .. .. rubric:: Trigger a power-off/on sequence on ARM Cortex-M33 ``@16mb`` revision:

      .. .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **hwinfo reset_cause**
            reset caused by:
            - pin

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **regulator disable vreg**
            [00:00:00.001,000] <inf> board_control: mini_usb_rp2350\ @\ 16mb/rp2350a/m33_0
            [00:00:00.001,000] <inf> board_control: QSPI-Flash: **16MB**
            \*\*\* Booting Zephyr OS build |zephyr_version_em|\ *…*\*\*\*
            Hello World! I'm THE SHELL from mini_usb_rp2350

      .. .. rubric:: Trigger a power-off/on sequence on Hazard3 RISC-V (RV32IMAC+) ``@4mb`` revision:

      .. .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **hwinfo reset_cause**
            reset caused by:
            - pin

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **regulator disable vreg**
            [00:00:00.001,000] <inf> board_control: mini_usb_rp2350\ @\ 4mb/rp2350a/hazard3_0
            [00:00:00.001,000] <inf> board_control: QSPI-Flash: **4MB**
            \*\*\* Booting Zephyr OS build |zephyr_version_em|\ *…*\*\*\*
            Hello World! I'm THE SHELL from mini_usb_rp2350

      .. .. rubric:: Trigger a power-off/on sequence on Hazard3 RISC-V (RV32IMAC+) ``@16mb`` revision:

      .. .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

